{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Silly Superstitions", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Black Cats", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects  in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Be Supposed To", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the past, present or future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + To be + supposed to + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">are not supposed to</span> be scared of witches. <br/>You <span class=\"strong\">are not supposed to</span> be scared of black cats. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**: When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Like this:<br/>Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Are you supposed to be scared?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You are not supposed to be afraid of any black cats.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was supposed to write about it yesterday.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences with <span class=\"italic\">If</span> Clause", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional with <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clauses to exchange opinions about possible future outcomes.<br/> You use the second conditional to exchange opinions about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional to say it's possible that you will or will not do something. In that condition, something else may, may not will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the second conditional to talk about hypothetical situations. There is no certainty that it's possible to fulfill the condition. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I  had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No.<br/> Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/> What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past verb</span> + <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">would</span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Conditional: 1st Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Conditional: 2nd Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">If I study today, </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll go to the party tonight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It's possible that I can go to the party tonight, but only if I study first. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second Conditional:<br/>If ... + Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second Conditional: would + base verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I were you,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I would bring the cat to my house.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It is an impossible situation. I am not you and this can only happen in a hypothetical situation.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If I had to have anything cross my path, it would be a black cat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I were a witch, I would definitely turn myself into a black cat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " If I were you, I would bring that scary cat over to my house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " If I had that power, I certainly wouldn't turn into a dog.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to address", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to deal with or pay attention to something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I was supposed to write about it yesterday, but I didn't get a chance.  So, I guess I'll address it now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about superstitions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "as opposed to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing contrast", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Black cats are such elegant creatures as opposed to smelly dogs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fan", "type": "name"}, {"content": " an enthusiastic follower or admirer of a team, sport, celebrity, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As you have guessed by now, I'm not a big fan of dogs. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "elegant", "type": "name"}, {"content": " graceful, polished, or luxurious in style, design, or form", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Black cats are very elegant animals.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to  be destined ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be intended for a particular purpose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Another interesting belief was that kittens that were born in May were believed to be destined to become a witch's cat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "creature", "type": "name"}, {"content": "anything that lives except plants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Black cats are such elegant creatures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "servant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works for another person for little compensation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The black cat myth was started in the Middle Ages when people believed that black cats were servants of witches.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, brainstorm all the powers that a witch might have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Answer the question: If I were a witch, what power would I like to have?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Individually, write a paragraph (6 to 8 sentences) about your power and how you would use it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write three hypothetical sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Draw a picture of you and your power.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the picture and your story with a group.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about manners, customs and superstitions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can talk about things I was supposed to do and things that were supposed to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can talk about hypothetical situations.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about manners, customs and superstitions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I was supposed to do and                           things that were supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Are you a dog person or a cat person? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "If you could have special powers, which powers would you like to have? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What happens if a black cat crosses your path?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "_