", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le17ob10re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le17ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le17ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le17ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "So when a black cat crosses your path, are you supposed to be scared? I am. -Tina from Miami.<br/><br/>Tina, if I had to have anything cross my path, it would be a black cat. I just love cats.\nThe black cat superstition was mentioned several times before in the mail bag and I was supposed to write about it yesterday, but I didn't get a chance.  So, I guess I'll address it now.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le17ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "The black cat myth was started in the Middle Ages when people believed that black cats were servants of witches. It was even thought that witches could turn into black cats, therefore making people very unhappy when one crossed their path.<br/>\nIf I were a witch, I would definitely turn myself into a black cat. Black cats are such elegant creatures as opposed to smelly dogs. If I had that power, I certainly wouldn't turn into a dog. As you have guessed by now, I am not a big fan of dogs.", "time": "23000"}, {"image": "engenn8le17ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Another interesting belief was that kittens that were born in May were believed to be destined to become a witch's cat. Kittens are so cute in any month. So Tina, in my opinion, you are not supposed to be afraid of any black cats. If I were you, I would bring the scary cat over to my house and I will give it some nice warm milk.<br/>\nHmmm.  Maybe I am a witch?", "time": "54000"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le17ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": "I've always believed in some superstitions. For example, you are not supposed to walk under a ladder or step on a crack that is on the floor. Moreover, I've heard some other ones in which you're not supposed to drop a mirror and break it or you'll get seven years of bad luck. There's another one about not passing salt to someone on the table and opening an umbrella indoors.<br/>Jane says that you are supposed to ... ", "type": "p"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0}]}